#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide_by_reference.rst:2
msgid "chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide\\_by\\_reference"
msgstr "chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide\\_by\\_reference"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/functions.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide_by_reference:1
msgid "Divide every row of ``X`` by a reference spectrum."
msgstr "``X`` の各行を参照スペクトルで除算します。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/functions.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide_by_reference:3
msgid ""
"Useful for single-beam transmission corrections or ratiometric normalisation "
"where each sample is divided by a simultaneously measured reference channel."
msgstr ""
"各サンプルを同時測定した参照チャンネルで除算する、シングルビーム透過補正や比"
"率正規化に役立ちます。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/functions.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide_by_reference:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/functions.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide_by_reference:7
msgid "Input spectra."
msgstr "入力スペクトル。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/functions.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide_by_reference:9
msgid ""
"Reference to divide by.  Accepted shapes:  * scalar ``float`` — divides "
"every element. * ``(1, n_features)`` — shared reference broadcast across all "
"samples. * ``(n_samples, 1)`` — per-sample scalar divisor. * ``(n_samples, "
"n_features)`` — per-sample full spectrum.  1-D inputs are rejected; use "
"``.reshape(1, -1)`` for a shared spectrum or ``.reshape(-1, 1)`` for a per-"
"sample scalar. Zero values are rejected because division by zero produces "
"non-finite output."
msgstr ""
"除数となる参照値。指定可能な形状: * スカラー ``float`` — すべての要素を除算。"
"* ``(1, n_features)`` — 全サンプルにブロードキャストする共通参照値。* "
"``(n_samples, 1)`` — サンプル別のスカラー除数。* ``(n_samples, n_features)`` "
"— サンプル別の完全なスペクトル。1 次元入力は受け付けません。共通スペクトルに"
"は ``.reshape(1, -1)``、サンプル別スカラーには ``.reshape(-1, 1)`` を使用して"
"ください。ゼロ値は、ゼロ除算によって非有限の出力が生じるため拒否されます。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/functions.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide_by_reference:9
msgid "Reference to divide by.  Accepted shapes:"
msgstr "除数となる参照値。指定可能な形状:"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/functions.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide_by_reference:11
msgid "scalar ``float`` — divides every element."
msgstr "スカラー ``float`` — すべての要素を除算します。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/functions.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide_by_reference:12
msgid "``(1, n_features)`` — shared reference broadcast across all samples."
msgstr "``(1, n_features)`` — 全サンプルにブロードキャストする共通参照値。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/functions.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide_by_reference:13
msgid "``(n_samples, 1)`` — per-sample scalar divisor."
msgstr "``(n_samples, 1)`` — サンプル別のスカラー除数。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/functions.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide_by_reference:14
msgid "``(n_samples, n_features)`` — per-sample full spectrum."
msgstr "``(n_samples, n_features)`` — サンプル別の完全なスペクトル。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/functions.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.divide_by_reference:16
msgid ""
"1-D inputs are rejected; use ``.reshape(1, -1)`` for a shared spectrum or "
"``.reshape(-1, 1)`` for a per-sample scalar. Zero values are rejected "
"because division by zero produces non-finite output."
msgstr ""
"1 次元入力は受け付けません。共通スペクトルには ``.reshape(1, -1)``、サンプル"
"別スカラーには ``.reshape(-1, 1)`` を使用してください。ゼロ値は、ゼロ除算に"
"よって非有限の出力が生じるため拒否されます。"

